{"seq": 4, "ts": "2026-10-05T01:37:33.496-07:00", "tool": "email_search", "args": {"query": "Q4 forecast", "folder": "inbox", "limit": 10, "unread_only": false}, "ok": true, "side_effects": [], "signals": [], "object_id": null, "result": {"folder": "inbox", "results": [{"id": "em-13", "received_at": "2026-10-26T07:58:00-06:00", "from": "lisa.park@larkspur.example", "subject": "EMEA Q4 numbers ready", "snippet": "Hi Maya, EMEA is done: EMEA Q4 forecast $2.8M, with most of the risk sitting in two distributor renewals. Tom wants you, me and Dan to go through the numbers be", "from_name": "Lisa Park", "unread": true}, {"id": "em-01", "received_at": "2026-10-26T07:55:00-06:00", "from": "tom.becker@larkspur.example", "subject": "Q4 forecast: sync before Friday", "snippet": "Morning Maya, Before we lock Q4, please get 30 minutes with Dan (finance) and Lisa this week so the three of you can walk through West and EMEA side by side. Da", "from_name": "Tom Becker", "unread": true}, {"id": "em-02", "received_at": "2026-10-26T07:40:00-06:00", "from": "priya.nair@larkspur.example", "subject": "Q4 forecast workbook v3", "snippet": "Hi Maya, v3 of the Q4 forecast workbook is on the shared drive. Headline for the region: West Q4 forecast $4.2M, commit $3.6M, upside $0.9M. The main change fro", "from_name": "Priya Nair", "unread": true}], "total": 3}}
{"seq": 5, "ts": "2026-10-05T01:37:33.497-07:00", "tool": "email_read", "args": {"email_id": "em-01"}, "ok": true, "side_effects": [], "signals": [], "object_id": "em-01", "result": {"id": "em-01", "folder": "inbox", "from": "tom.becker@larkspur.example", "from_name": "Tom Becker", "to": ["maya.chen@larkspur.example"], "cc": [], "received_at": "2026-10-26T07:55:00-06:00", "subject": "Q4 forecast: sync before Friday", "body": "Morning Maya,\n\nBefore we lock Q4, please get 30 minutes with Dan (finance) and Lisa this week so the three of you can walk through West and EMEA side by side. Dan wants to pressure-test the commit before it goes in, and Lisa has her numbers ready. I need the final numbers to me by Friday noon so I can roll them into the board pack over the weekend. If anything is slipping, tell me early rather than late.\n\nTom", "thread": [], "maya_replied": false}}
{"seq": 6, "ts": "2026-10-05T01:37:33.498-07:00", "tool": "email_read", "args": {"email_id": "em-13"}, "ok": true, "side_effects": [], "signals": [], "object_id": "em-13", "result": {"id": "em-13", "folder": "inbox", "from": "lisa.park@larkspur.example", "from_name": "Lisa Park", "to": ["maya.chen@larkspur.example"], "cc": [], "received_at": "2026-10-26T07:58:00-06:00", "subject": "EMEA Q4 numbers ready", "body": "Hi Maya,\n\nEMEA is done: EMEA Q4 forecast $2.8M, with most of the risk sitting in two distributor renewals. Tom wants you, me and Dan to go through the numbers before they go in. Wednesday afternoon my time is best for the forecast review. Please note I'm out of office Friday, so anything that needs me has to land by Thursday.\n\nSpeak soon,\nLisa", "thread": [], "maya_replied": false}}
